---
title: "Branch download lock cleanup"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Waiting to create the lock
  s1: Lock created, cleanup not yet registered
  s2: Download owns its lock
  s3: Download is returning
  s4: Download has stopped
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Lock is created
  s1 --> s2: Lock cleanup is registered
  s2 --> s3: Download returns
  s3 --> s4: Lock is removed
